      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Allen & Jacobs is delighted to present this extended lovely bay windowed semi-detached residence providing well-proportioned light filled accommodation throughout c.115sqm/1,238sqft. Overlooking a mature green area to the front, no.30 also benefits from a private westerly orientated garden to the rear.\n\nRoebuck Castle is a lovely well-maintained development located just off Roebuck Road, which has abundance of mature green areas and communal tennis courts. Ideally located only a stone`s throw away from the Deer Park, a lovely, landscaped parkland providing excellent recreational facilities including a tennis club, playground and delightful walking areas in which to enjoy the elevated views over Dublin Bay & city. Stillorgan, Blackrock & Dundrum are all within easy reach and the local amenities of Mount Merrion village are within easy walking distance. There is an extensive & excellent range of local schools within walking and cycling distance, to include Scoil San Treasa, Mount Anville Primary/Secondary, Colaiste Iosagain, Colaiste Eoin, Our Lady`s Grove, Oatlands College & St. Kilian`s, to name just a few. UCD is on your doorstep with excellent sporting facilities & various walking/running/cycling routes. There are bus routes nearby on Roebuck Road, Fosters Avenue & the QBC is available on the N11 with the M50 within easy reach.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises hall, guest toilet, living room, dining room, kitchen/breakfast room & utility area. Upstairs are 4 bedrooms (master en-suite) and a bathroom.\n\nAt A Glance\nExtended bay windowed semi-detached residence\nLight filled accommodation c.115sqm/1,238sqft.\nSecluded c.7m garden westerly garden to the rear\nOff-street parking for 2 cars to the front\nGFCH \nDouble glazed windows\nOverlooking green area to the front\nGuest toilet \nSide entrance\nCommunal tennis court\nClose to QBC\nBeside UCD\n\nAccommodation\nHall: 5.3m x 1.8m\nGuest toilet: 1.4m x .8m\nLiving room: 5.3m x 3.5m\nDining room: 3.6m x 3.3m\nKitchen/breakfast room: 5.2m x 3m\nUtility area: 4m x 2\n\nUpstairs\nBedroom 1: 2.6m x 2.6m\nBedroom 2: 3.3m x 2.7m\nBathroom: 2m x 1.7m\nBedroom 3: 3.9m x 3.2m\nEn-suite: 1.7m x 1.5m\nBedroom 4: 3m x 2.1m\n\nOutside\nTo the front is a walled garden with planted area and off-street parking for 2 cars. There is also access to side entrance. To the rear is a private c.7m low maintenance private garden with westerly orientation & storage shed. \n\nViewing\nStrictly by prior appointment only with sole agents \nAllen & Jacobs (Southside Office) \n107 Fosters Avenue \nMount Merrion, Co. Dublin \nt: 2100360 \ne: info@allenandjacobs.ie\nw: allenandjacobs.ie\n\nNegotiator\nGary Jacobs MSCSI MRICS\n"
      },
